==Location and Uses==
==={{OoT|-}}===
Topazes are [[Ganondorf]]'s favorite type of [[Gem]]. As a result, he wears several of them, and they adorn his [[Weapon]]s as well.<ref name="HH 148"/><ref name="E 21"/>

==={{BotW|-}}===
Topazes can be found by destroying [[Ore Deposit]]s and [[Rare Ore Deposit]]s, as well as by defeating [[Stone Talus (Rare)|Stone Taluses (Rare)]]. The [[Traveling Merchant]] [[Kairo]] and the store [[Ore and More]] both sell Topazes for differing amounts. They are precious [[Gem]]s that are said to have the power of [[Electricity]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

The jewelry shop [[Starlight Memories]] requires five Topazes as payment for the [[Topaz Earrings]]. In addition, the merchant [[Ramella]] in [[Goron City]] will occasionally ask for Topazes, paying more than the regular price.<ref name="BotW Ramella"/> The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] also accepts Topazes as an ingredient for [[Yellow Dye]].

Topazes are required to [[Enhancing|Enhance]] the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Topaz}}

